    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:901803a8cbb31cead8f25ddb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "运用“战术”控制斗争心──\n这是我在当上她的签约训练员前，\n和她一起找出的方法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf6c0271b47196725a7f042eedb94b5cd7b7a934624c96be810953815ab806f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        47,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/47/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bcb59e2b002d7b3e7d52bea",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "八重无敌平常总是很冷静。\n不过在比赛时会显露出原本的性格，\n带着斗争心与对手较劲。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91a263326dab5178629ad765fbe3948a161b79a6c0ff8896b2bad0176fc03dd0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        48,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/48/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd7f24f461c4bf2dba06f6f9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我因在意她的这种两面性而认识了她，\n并和她一起思考控制斗争心的方法──",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22726cb56aa270081e50ba765eda2936b9cfaec8bccf0304d8d7e8b05466e11",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1072/storytimeline_501072100.json",
      "json_path": [
