    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c8eca7e7bdcda8fa2692ac0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我们最后的结论是金刚八重垣流的“形”，\n就相当于比赛中的“战术”。\n然后我们成功运用战术控制了斗争心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d4aeceef7c02c5ca4ff72b8388c589bdb9cce150069f5298786db242f96d8bf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
